    "_id": "6aa266dd2e3f2695c1294832",
    "title": "Guest Talk -04",
    "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">We are pleased to invite you to an insightful guest session with <b>Sivarajah Ramanathan, Former CEO of StartupTN and Governing Council Member of TRACE</b>.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Topic: </b><i>How to Build an Investable Startup – Insights on Building, Scaling, and Attracting Investment</i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">This session will provide practical insights into building a strong startup, creating real value, attracting investors, and developing a business with the potential to scale.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">The session will be especially valuable for <b>entrepreneurs, aspiring founders, students, innovators, and anyone interested in startups and investment</b>.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Event Details:</b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Date:</b> 17 August 2026</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Time:</b> 5:30 PM onwards</li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><b>Venue:</b> <a href=\"https://share.google/0Zf5RfYL0IxEo8LyX\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://share.google/0Zf5RfYL0IxEo8LyX&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1789110444925000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xqfhsWr4M3vsV3SyQ2HLa\" style=\"color: rgb(70, 120, 134);\">Bay 07, TRACE Expert City, Colombo 10</a></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; line-height: 14.95px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\">We warmly invite you to join us for this valuable session.</p>",
